{"id": "DfAFjhazPxH", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why does Hanuman ji sit with his eyes closed, smiling? Because in water, on earth and across the sky, only Ram carries us across. 🙏\n\nजल थल गगन मण्डल में राम\nराम ही पार लगावेंगे\n\nWherever Hanuman ji goes, he carries one name in his heart. Watch it turn around him, राम राम राम, while he sits in the quiet of the forest.\n\nSave this for the days you need a little peace, and send it to someone who needs Ram’s name today.\n\nStories of Hanuman ji, Ram and the gods, written for kids: Rishi Katha books, Books 1–3 as a set for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\nFollow @therishikatha for more.\n\n#hanuman #hanumanji #jaishriram #ram #shriram bajrangbali ramnaam ramayan hanumanchalisa sanatandharma bhakti hindu devotional spiritualreels rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793111888, "like_count": 7510, "comment_count": 42, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1643816823821854a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.66, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMNdJXtVGs2fc3rf06v6BvRUtiRzhbV6-HGUZuaoidg4q0wEJ1VthL0hLOgdJOSf1Tt2GCxSxm6XaANwWbyqWPjUMqM5CYT9QueIL0.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdrSYTK2neyNnX0zAh0VnMXzQgMds-82d9Y3Z9J6msWADJmHt_nXWsOxn-tfWUIzgo5az5n1E2AGBP1eCz1-afCF&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=RyZy_K9ly-cQ7kNvwHUaVo1&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=DvMHTZUijeZCgGjMDNAjeg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ0uvSWC9ztWza-Eyvri08u521LeUatVDW26pY5wLieEw&oe=6AF41EB1", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 66.66, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x6